WEBVTT

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<u>I  LOVE  ANIME</u>

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
STUDIO  RIVA - Nyo

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<b>#ILA @ Rizon</b>

00:06.220 --> 00:12.920
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakeru made</b>

00:13.500 --> 00:19.260
<b>Ichinichi mainichi wo tanoshiku ikite</b>

00:19.500 --> 00:24.770
<b>Totsuzen umarekuru setsuna no fuan</b>

00:25.280 --> 00:31.370
<b>2000-nen mondai yori
jibun no yume</b>

00:31.480 --> 00:37.350
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakitai</b>

00:37.450 --> 00:40.420
<b>Omoi wa number 1 star</b>

00:40.520 --> 00:43.490
<b>Kono sora no naka de</b>

00:50.080 --> 00:52.670
<b>My stomach hurts.</b>

00:52.780 --> 00:55.380
<b>I shouldn't have eaten
food off of the floor.</b>

00:55.720 --> 00:57.020
<b>At least it was only gas.</b>

00:57.120 --> 00:58.480
<b>Does your stomach hurt?</b>

00:58.590 --> 00:59.610
<b>What?</b>

00:59.720 --> 01:01.550
<b>Does it hurt, your stomach?</b>

01:02.460 --> 01:05.950
<b>Yeah, I ate some natto bread
off the floor...</b>

01:07.330 --> 01:08.520
<b>Bottle labelled Diarrhea Express</b>

01:07.330 --> 01:08.520
<b>Why don't you take this?</b>

01:08.630 --> 01:09.890
<b>Huh?</b>

01:10.000 --> 01:12.160
<b>Oh, thank you.</b>

01:15.570 --> 01:17.510
<b>Whew, I feel much better now.</b>

01:17.610 --> 01:20.300
<b>You should stop eating
food off the floor.</b>

01:20.410 --> 01:23.470
<b>Yeah, I know, but the bota-mochi
looked so delicious and-</b>

01:23.580 --> 01:25.410
<b>Oh no! I need to get going!</b>

01:25.510 --> 01:26.810
<b>What? Oh...
See you later!</b>

01:26.920 --> 01:27.780
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

01:27.880 --> 01:29.650
<b>Excuse me!</b>

01:31.620 --> 01:36.460
<b>I didn't even get to thank her
for helping me through my diarrhea.</b>

01:39.660 --> 01:41.930
<b>She dropped this.
I have to find her.</b>

01:43.230 --> 01:44.670
<b>I'm late! I'm late!</b>

01:48.040 --> 01:50.530
<b>Dice... Which means Rabi...</b>

01:50.640 --> 01:51.770
<b>Huh?</b>

01:52.140 --> 01:53.270
<b>Oh no!</b>

01:53.380 --> 01:55.000
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

01:55.110 --> 01:56.270
<b>That's okay.</b>

01:57.880 --> 01:59.540
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

01:59.650 --> 02:03.480
<b>I was rushing to change,
and I guess I didn't put it on right.</b>

02:03.590 --> 02:06.050
<b>Don't worry, I'm okay.</b>

02:06.420 --> 02:09.080
<b>Oh, I think you dropped this.</b>

02:09.190 --> 02:11.960
<b>Oh, that's mine!
Thank you.</b>

02:12.060 --> 02:15.000
<b>So it was you.
Thank you for helping me.</b>

02:15.100 --> 02:16.530
<b>Hey, no problem.</b>

02:16.630 --> 02:18.500
<b>Yeah, thanks.</b>

02:20.440 --> 02:22.060
<b>Oh, um!</b>

02:23.270 --> 02:25.100
<b>Why do you wear dice
on your head?</b>

02:25.210 --> 02:29.010
<b>Oh?
Well... about the dice...</b>

02:31.280 --> 02:34.180
<b>You don't need to tell me
if you don't want to.</b>

02:34.280 --> 02:35.770
<b>I'm sorry I asked.</b>

02:35.890 --> 02:37.850
<b>You see, my mom and dad...</b>

02:38.850 --> 02:41.720
<b>gave this to me
before they left for America.</b>

02:42.890 --> 02:44.830
<b>What?
You're leaving me alone?</b>

02:44.930 --> 02:45.890
<b>That's right.</b>

02:46.000 --> 02:49.590
<b>Your mother and I are going to America,
but you're staying in Japan, Hikaru.</b>

02:49.700 --> 02:51.720
<b>We're leaving you penniless,</b>

02:51.830 --> 02:54.460
<b>but someday, you'll make a fortune
and become an idol.</b>

02:54.570 --> 02:55.940
<b>Try your best, Hikaru.</b>

02:56.040 --> 02:58.970
<b>To become an idol,
you'll need this.</b>

03:01.410 --> 03:02.380
<b>Dice!</b>

03:02.480 --> 03:04.340
<b>But why?</b>

03:04.450 --> 03:08.080
<b>Sign : To America</b>

03:04.450 --> 03:08.080
<b>We have to solve Japan's trade
problems with the United States!</b>

03:08.180 --> 03:10.080
<b>Aloha oye oye.</b>

03:10.190 --> 03:13.640
<b>Answer me!
Why do I need dice?</b>

03:15.320 --> 03:17.160
<b>So that's why.</b>

03:20.160 --> 03:22.760
<b>I guess everyone has problems.
Usada!</b>

03:23.370 --> 03:25.730
<b>You can't ditch work nyo!</b>

03:25.840 --> 03:28.000
<b>Oh, I'm sorry.</b>

03:28.100 --> 03:31.130
<b>Rabi-en-Rose, the number one idol,
will come to the rescue.</b>

03:32.170 --> 03:35.740
<b>What are you talking about nyo?
I'm the number one idol nyo.</b>

03:35.850 --> 03:38.750
<b>It's me.
It's me nyo.</b>

03:39.350 --> 03:41.110
<b>Tres bien.</b>

03:41.220 --> 03:44.210
<b>Good luck, Rabi-en-Rose.</b>
